{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_01",
      "hash": "eb0270625db7e4cb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_05",
      "hash": "eb0274625db7eb97",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳在培育寶可夢時，\\n有[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳自己的原則嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_06",
      "hash": "eb0275625db7ed4a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "我的原則就是……\\n用我的水屬性寶可夢\\r\\n不斷進攻進攻再進攻喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_07",
      "hash": "eb0276625db7eefd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好了！就讓世界級的美少女\\n小霞我來當[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的對手吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_08",
      "hash": "eb0267625db7d580",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "去吧！\\n我的寶貝！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_02_01",
      "hash": "727c3d2a1a30cc28",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 5]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_02_06",
      "hash": "727c442a1a30d80d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 6]"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_02",
      "hash": "eb0271625db7e67e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "真沒辦法！\\c\\n這個藍色徽章就送給[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳，\\n當成是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳戰勝我的證明吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main8010_sys_01",
      "hash": "fa93f3e6a1687f4d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從小霞那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]藍色徽章[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_03",
      "hash": "eb0272625db7e831",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "有了藍色徽章，\\n就算是別人送[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的寶可夢，\\r\\n只要等級在30以內，\\r\\n都會乖乖聽[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳的話喔！\\c\\n……還有，這個是我\\n引以為傲的招式學習器！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main8010_sys_02",
      "hash": "fa93f0e6a1687a34",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從小霞那裡\\n得到了[VAR ITEM2(0001)]\\r\\n「[VAR COLOR(0006)][VAR MOVE(0002)][VAR COLOR(0000)]」！"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main8010_water_04",
      "hash": "eb0273625db7e9e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "招式學習器29可以\\n讓寶可夢學會「熱水」。\\c\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳要讓住在水裡的寶可夢\\n學學這個招式喔！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_02_05",
      "hash": "727c412a1a30d2f4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 12]"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_gymleader_02_02",
